      "content": "LITTLE GADDESDEN       \tLITTLE GADDESDEN SP 9913  \t\t\t\t\t(East side)                                        9/193 -                                       \tNo. 44 GV                                       \tII House. Late C18. Red brick chequered with black headers. Twin pitched slate roof. Gabled open porch to front. Simple and unspoilt. Included for group value. Listing NGR: SP9945713142"
